    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate the rooms</strong>: Turn the chambers to <strong>create new paths</strong> and reach unexplored areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move the pieces</strong>: Slide rooms into <strong>empty spaces</strong> to connect with other chambers and progress through the labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/0a5fc2b93f9fbfb0fbe6ce00653322b1.poster.avif?t=1753398534\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/0a5fc2b93f9fbfb0fbe6ce00653322b1.webm?t=1753398534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/0a5fc2b93f9fbfb0fbe6ce00653322b1.mp4?t=1753398534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Hamstermind</strong>, you play as the legendary <strong>Hamster Jones</strong>, a fearless explorer accompanied by his quirky team. Trapped inside an ancient pyramid, your mission is to <strong>solve complex puzzles</strong> and uncover the mysteries hidden within this sacred place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/e1ca171286e15e9d1d1386d59ee6eda7.avif?t=1753398534\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve optional puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on extra challenges for the most daring explorers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/036e2cc24e727d76e89a52b779e54f3d.poster.avif?t=1753398534\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/036e2cc24e727d76e89a52b779e54f3d.webm?t=1753398534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/036e2cc24e727d76e89a52b779e54f3d.mp4?t=1753398534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate the rooms</strong>: Turn the chambers to <strong>create new paths</strong> and reach unexplored areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move the pieces</strong>: Slide rooms into <strong>empty spaces</strong> to connect with other chambers and progress through the labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/0a5fc2b93f9fbfb0fbe6ce00653322b1.poster.avif?t=1753398534\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/0a5fc2b93f9fbfb0fbe6ce00653322b1.webm?t=1753398534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/0a5fc2b93f9fbfb0fbe6ce00653322b1.mp4?t=1753398534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Hamstermind</strong>, you play as the legendary <strong>Hamster Jones</strong>, a fearless explorer accompanied by his quirky team. Trapped inside an ancient pyramid, your mission is to <strong>solve complex puzzles</strong> and uncover the mysteries hidden within this sacred place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/e1ca171286e15e9d1d1386d59ee6eda7.avif?t=1753398534\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve optional puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on extra challenges for the most daring explorers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/036e2cc24e727d76e89a52b779e54f3d.poster.avif?t=1753398534\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/036e2cc24e727d76e89a52b779e54f3d.webm?t=1753398534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555520/extras/036e2cc24e727d76e89a52b779e54f3d.mp4?t=1753398534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
